== Redmine Tags plugin changelog

Redmine Tags plugin - Tags board plugin for redmine
Copyright (C) 2011-2026 Kirill Bezrukov (RedmineUP)
http://www.redmineup.com/

== 2026-08-23 v0.0.5

Development start after 0.0.4 Stable freeze.
Plugin ID: :redmineup_tags
Target: Redmine 7.0.0 / Ruby 3.4 / Rails 8.1
Version in init.rb: 0.0.5 (Dev)

Custom clouds
* Plugin setting «Display open issues only» applies only to the default Tags cloud
* Custom clouds use project-level filters only (status Any = all issues, including closed)
* Sidebar counts, preview and tag click links follow the same rule
* Equal issue counts sort alphabetically (A–Z), independent of count direction
* System cloud title shows current setting: open only / all

Personal visibility
* System Tags cloud can be hidden per user on the current project (Select visible tag clouds)
* System row is first in the modal, not sortable
* Stored in user preferences (no extra table)
* Plugin / project settings for the system cloud stay read-only

== 2026-08-22 v0.0.4

Stable freeze. Plugin ID: :redmineup_tags
Target: Redmine 7.0.0 / Ruby 3.4 / Rails 8.1
Version in init.rb: 0.0.4 (Stable)

Admin
* Tab «Tag Clouds» on plugin settings — global list of custom clouds
* Columns: Name, Project, Filters, Visibility, Author, Visible by default, Include subprojects
* Edit/Delete only (no create, no reorder)
* Admin bypasses project membership; redirect back to the settings tab

Inherited clouds (parent → subproject)
* Shown in subproject settings with R/К marker; system cloud with S/С
* Edit / delete / reorder inherited clouds from the subproject (home-project positions)
* Select visible modal: inherited and local groups, in-group sort, no group titles
* Sidebar containers: system → inherited → local
* Settings tab hidden without manage_tag_clouds

Filters
* Operators match Redmine 7 Issue List (status / tracker / version + history)
* Version values: open + locked only
* Root cloud tracker/version lists union of project + descendants
* Name limited to 100 characters

Visibility & permissions
* Author only selectable by the cloud author (disabled otherwise)
* Author name shown on the Author only option
* Roles list as checkboxes (givable roles fallback)
* owner_id synced to created_by_id

UI
* Word wrap for long unbroken names
* Modal bulk check/uncheck, width 560px
* Settings table responsive + zebra from the system row
* Small hint font for subprojects text

Schema notes
* If operators columns are missing: rake redmine:plugins:migrate NAME=redmineup_tags
  or redmineup_tags:repair_schema, then restart

Docs
* doc/RELEASE_0.0.4.md

== 2026-08-15 v0.0.3

Release: remaining logic + permissions (tag_filter UI, visibility UI)
Target: Redmine 7.0 / Ruby 3.4 / Rails 8.1
Plugin ID: :redmineup_tags

Form & visibility
* UI for visibility: all / owner / roles (radio)
* Roles multi-select when visibility=roles; validation requires ≥1 role
* Owner auto-assigned to current user when visibility=owner
* UI for tag_filter: whitelist of project tags; empty whitelist ⇒ empty cloud
* Settings table shows visibility summary column
* Locales EN/RU for all new labels and permission help text

Permissions
* manage_tag_clouds (require: :member) — CRUD + reorder
* select_tag_clouds — personal sidebar visibility modal
* Cloud-level visibility rule applied in visible_for? before preference override
* Documented in settings info text

Logic
* Controller syncs role_ids / tag_ids on create/update; clears when not applicable
* Model assigned_role_ids / assigned_tag_ids work for new records before save
* Unit tests for owner, roles, tag_filter, uniqueness, preferences

== 2026-08-10 v0.0.2-beta

Release tag: v0.0.2-beta
Target: Redmine 7.0 / Ruby 3.4 / Rails 8.1
Plugin ID: :redmineup_tags (compatibility with RedmineUP Q&A and other tag plugins)

Schema & models
* Force-rebuild multi-project schema (tag_clouds, tag_cloud_projects, tag_cloud_tags, tag_cloud_roles, tag_cloud_preferences)
* Tags/taggings preserved
* TagCloud without project_id / is_system / position; join models for project link and order
* Default Tags cloud is virtual (not stored in DB)
* visible_for? with visibility all|owner|roles + user preference override

Display & filtering
* TagCloudAggregator: real RedmineUP tags only; empty filters = all; include_subprojects; open_only from plugin settings
* Sidebar: system Tags + custom clouds ordered by tag_cloud_projects.position
* Settings: filters summary, create/edit filters, include_subprojects, visible_by_default
* Preferences modal: per-user visibility + drag order
* Default plugin settings: simple_cloud sidebar, show issue counts

Fixes
* Tag click links use Redmine f/op/v + set_filter so issue list applies immediately (no second Apply)
* Helpers on ProjectsController; plugin controllers declare helpers
* Locales EN/RU for multi tag clouds

Docs
* doc/TEST_DISPLAY_FILTERS.md — manual QA checklist
* doc/RELEASE_0.0.2-beta.md — release notes

